{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:91a663a42595a40f","name":"The Shadow Academy","source":{"id":"source:reference-91a663a42595a40f","title":"The Shadow Academy","revision":20519,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:00:36Z","sha256":"6707025f467fa20fbcf8b2c164d6b5dde7e7007f5608714461c3b3baa8dcd160","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20519","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=The%20Shadow%20Academy&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-91a663a42595a40f","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["One of Luke Skywalker's early failures as leader of the New Jedi Order is ",{"tag":"a","children":["Brakiss"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Brakiss","referenceId":"reference:a40b8681defef8df"},". The young student's fall to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"}," of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," forces him to leave the academy and pursue training elsewhere. With the assistance of a group of witches from the Nightsister clan of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dathomir"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dathomir?action=edit&redlink=1"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Brakiss"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Brakiss","referenceId":"reference:a40b8681defef8df"}," establishes The Shadow Academy for the Second Imperium of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"},". The Shadow Academy becomes ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"}," equivalent of Skywalker's Jedi Praxeum on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Yavin 4"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Yavin_4","referenceId":"reference:5f008a1b1f754b64"},". Unlike the doctrines of the Nightsisters, The Shadow Academy allows both male and female members. The students undergo a rigorous training regime to push them toward graduating as full-fledged Dark Jedi, ready to fight and eliminate ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"}," under Skywalker's tutelage.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The students of The Shadow Academy serve to defend their school, much like ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"}," students on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Yavin 4"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Yavin_4","referenceId":"reference:5f008a1b1f754b64"},", as well as help achieve the goals of their masters, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Brakiss"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Brakiss","referenceId":"reference:a40b8681defef8df"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tamith Kai"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tamith_Kai","referenceId":"reference:0d3551b5c498a7cc"},". Time and again, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Brakiss"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Brakiss","referenceId":"reference:a40b8681defef8df"}," uses his students as pawns in his plans to eliminate ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The students of The Shadow Academy harass ",{"tag":"a","children":["Luke Skywalker"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Luke_Skywalker","referenceId":"reference:9d008045040e138b"}," and his students for several years through one plan or another. However, much of the influence of The Shadow Academy comes to a close after the destruction of the space station where it is housed, and Brakiss's subsequent death aboard it. Many students survive the station's destruction by being elsewhere at the time and pursue the secrets of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"}," on their own.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Shadow Academy Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Nonheroic Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["NAME\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHALLENGE LEVEL\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SOURCE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Shadow Academy Junior Student"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shadow_Academy_Junior_Student","referenceId":"reference:38215f2068938c23"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 2\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Shadow Academy Senior Student"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shadow_Academy_Senior_Student","referenceId":"reference:7d31bb9e76fd7330"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 6\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Heroic Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["NAME\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHALLENGE LEVEL\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SOURCE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Tamith Kai"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tamith_Kai","referenceId":"reference:0d3551b5c498a7cc"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 10\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Brakiss"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Brakiss","referenceId":"reference:a40b8681defef8df"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 11\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"br","children":[]},"\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
